<html>
<head><title>Samples</title></head>
<body>
    <div id='h'>Samples</div>
    <p>
        Note: these samples were encoded using Speex version 0.7.0.
        The quality has improved slightly since then.
    </p>
    <h1>Narrowband</h1>
    <p>These samples are coded using the narrowband Speex mode:</p>
    <h2>Male Sample</h2>
